[00:01.62] (Bob Wills)
[00:19.34] When the evening falls
[00:22.72] Twilight shadows find
[00:27.96] There beneath the stars
[00:32.50] An Indian maiden divine.
[00:37.02] The moon is on high
[00:41.58] And seems to see her there
[00:45.78] In her eyes there's a light shining ever so bright
[00:50.84] As she whispers a silent prayer.
[00:56.32] Every word reveals
[01:00.20] An empty broken heart
[01:06.12] Broken by fate
[01:09.10] That's keepin' them so far apart.
[01:14.16] Lonely there she kneels
[01:18.54] And tells the stars above
[01:22.46] In her arms he belongs and her prayer
[01:26.46] Is a song, her undying song of love.
[02:09.68] --- Instrumental ---
